{{!--
« Précédent » or « Suivant » link of a series (series box and series line at the end of the article).
Handlebars cannot look one item back or ahead, so the neighbour is found with {{#foreach}} windows of two
parts (from the part's own position, limit 2): the part after the current one is the second part of the
window that starts at the current one; the part before it is the part whose window ends on the current
one. Only the link that shows is rendered (at the first or last part the step is empty and the CSS hides it).
The block parameters (opts, outer) name the partial's parameters and the part of the outer loop: ../ would
point at the wrong context when a window starts at the very part it is looking from.
Parameters:
  parts         the published parts, in order (from {{#get}}), with id, title and url
  current       id of the post being read
  direction     "prev" | "next"
  detailed=true also show the part's title under the label (series line at the end of the article). The
                link's name is then its visible text (« Suivant Titre »); without it (series box) the label
                only is visible and aria-label gives the destination (« Suivant : Titre »).
--}}
{{#with this as |opts|}}
<span class="series-step series-step--{{opts.direction}}{{#if opts.detailed}} series-step--detailed{{/if}}">
  {{~#match opts.direction "prev"~}}
    {{~#foreach opts.parts~}}{{~#with this as |outer|~}}
      {{~#foreach opts.parts from=@number limit="2"~}}
        {{~#match id opts.current~}}{{~#match outer.id opts.current~}}{{~else~}}
          <a class="series-step__link" href="{{outer.url}}"{{#unless opts.detailed}} aria-label="{{t "Previous: {title}" title=outer.title}}"{{/unless}}>
            {{> "icons/arrow-left" class="icon-flip-rtl"}}
            <span class="series-step__text"><span class="series-step__label">{{t "Previous"}}</span>{{#if opts.detailed}} <span class="series-step__title">{{outer.title}}</span>{{/if}}</span>
          </a>
        {{~/match~}}{{~/match~}}
      {{~/foreach~}}
    {{~/with~}}{{~/foreach~}}
  {{~else~}}
    {{~#foreach opts.parts~}}
      {{~#match id opts.current~}}
        {{~#foreach opts.parts from=@number limit="2"~}}
          {{~#match id opts.current~}}{{~else~}}
            <a class="series-step__link" href="{{url}}"{{#unless opts.detailed}} aria-label="{{t "Next: {title}" title=title}}"{{/unless}}>
              <span class="series-step__text"><span class="series-step__label">{{t "Next"}}</span>{{#if opts.detailed}} <span class="series-step__title">{{title}}</span>{{/if}}</span>
              {{> "icons/arrow-right" class="icon-flip-rtl"}}
            </a>
          {{~/match~}}
        {{~/foreach~}}
      {{~/match~}}
    {{~/foreach~}}
  {{~/match~}}
</span>
{{/with}}
